---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Daily schedule"
description: "Daily timetables for each group at Palm River Academy, from Nursery to Year 9."
---

<div class="wrap page-head">
  <p class="eyebrow">Families</p>
  <h1>The daily schedule</h1>
  <p class="lede">Each group's day is a mix of Cambridge subject time, vocational classes, PE, and pastoral time. Open your child's group.</p>
</div>

<section class="band--paper faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% set groups = ["Nursery", "Kindergarten", "Years 1 and 2", "Years 4 and 5", "Year 6", "Year 8", "Year 9"] %}
    {% for g in groups %}
    <details>
      <summary>{{ g }}</summary>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Monday</th><th>Tuesday</th><th>Wednesday</th><th>Thursday</th><th>Friday</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>8:00</td><td colspan="5" class="todo">TODO: paste the {{ g }} timetable here (or move all timetables into src/_data/schedule.json).</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

